    landingHeroLede: 'A Finnish language platform built for the YKI exam, workplace communication, and the long path to citizenship — for learners, employers, and cities.',
    landingHeroDemoCaption: 'Watch the loop: type Finnish → get corrected → learn the rule.',
    landingAlreadyHaveAccount: 'Already have an account?',
    landingProblemEyebrow: 'THE PROBLEM',
    landingProblemTitleLine1: 'General Finnish study',
    landingProblemTitleLine2: "isn't enough for real outcomes.",
    landingProblemBody: 'Generic language apps teach Finnish in the abstract. Floently teaches the Finnish you actually need for the things that change your life: passing YKI, getting hired, becoming a citizen.',
    landingOutcomeWallTitle: 'YKI is a wall, not a finish line',
    landingOutcomeWallBody: 'Many learners need more than general language lessons. They need Finnish for the YKI exam itself, for work, for daily communication — and for the long climb to citizenship and permanent residence.',
    landingOutcomeWorkplaceTitle: 'Workplace Finnish is a different skill',
    landingOutcomeWorkplaceBody: 'International employees need practical Finnish for safer communication on shift, smoother onboarding, and language confidence that supports retention rather than friction.',
    landingOutcomeCitiesTitle: 'Cities own the integration outcome',
    landingOutcomeCitiesBody: 'Residents need language support that connects learning to employability, inclusion, and meaningful participation in Finnish society — not just classroom completion certificates.',
    landingPlatformEyebrow: 'ONE PLATFORM, THREE PATHWAYS',
    landingPlatformTitleLine1: 'YKI, workplace,',
    landingPlatformTitleHighlight: 'and life in Finland.',
    landingPlatformBody: 'Three pathways under one platform. Pick the one that matches your goal — or run all three for an institution.',
    landingPlatformYkiEyebrow: 'YKI Preparation',
    landingPlatformYkiTitle: 'Built around the four exam skills.',
    landingPlatformYkiBody: 'Speaking, writing, reading, listening — guided practice with feedback that maps to YKI scoring rubrics for work, citizenship, and permanent residence.',
    landingPlatformProfessionalEyebrow: 'Professional Finnish',
    landingPlatformProfessionalTitle: 'For doctors, nurses, practical nurses.',
    landingPlatformProfessionalBody: 'Profession-specific scenarios, vocabulary, and dialogues. Patient handovers, clinical documentation, daily teamwork — language for the real job, not textbook situations.',
    landingPlatformLifeEyebrow: 'Life in Finland',
    landingPlatformLifeTitle: 'Daily services, official communication.',
    landingPlatformLifeBody: 'The Finnish you need for KELA, Migri, healthcare, schools, banks, and the long-term goals of citizenship and permanent residence.',
    landingInsideEyebrow: "WHAT'S INSIDE",
    landingInsideTitleLine1: 'One platform connecting',
    landingInsideTitleLine2: 'YKI, work, and settlement.',
    landingInsideBody: 'Every learner moves between exam preparation, professional Finnish, and daily life Finnish. Floently keeps them in one continuous track.',
