    "landingHeroLede": "Madal luqadda Finnishka ah oo loo dhisay imtixaanka YKI, xiriirka goobta shaqada, iyo waddada dheer ee dhalashada - ardayda, loo shaqeeyaha, iyo magaalooyinka.",
