    "landingProblemEyebrow": "DHIBAATADA",
    "landingProblemTitleLine1": "Waxbarashada guud ee finnishka",
    "landingProblemTitleLine2": "kuma filna natiijooyinka dhabta ah.",
    "landingProblemBody": "Barnaamijyada luqadaha guud waxay ku baraan Finnishka qaab aan la taaban karin. Floently wuxuu baraa Finnishka aad dhab ahaantii ugu baahan tahay waxyaalaha noloshaada beddelaya: ku gudubka YKI, shaqaaleysiin, noqoshada muwaadin.",
    "landingOutcomeWallTitle": "YKI waa gidaar, maaha khad dhammays ah",
    "landingOutcomeWallBody": "Arday badan ayaa u baahan in ka badan casharrada luqadda guud. Waxay u baahan yihiin Finnishka YKI laftiisa, shaqo ahaan, xiriir maalmeed - iyo fuulitaanka dheer ee dhalashada iyo degenaanshaha rasmiga ah.",
    "landingOutcomeWorkplaceTitle": "Goobta shaqada ee Finnishku waa xirfad kale",
    "landingOutcomeWorkplaceBody": "Shaqaalaha caalamiga ah waxay u baahan yihiin Finnish wax ku ool ah si ay u helaan wada-xiriir badbaado leh oo ku saabsan beddelka, fuushanaanta fudud, iyo kalsoonida luqadda ee taageerta sii-haynta halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd khilaaf.",
    "landingOutcomeCitiesTitle": "Magaalooyinka ayaa leh natiijada isdhexgalka",
    "landingOutcomeCitiesBody": "Deganayaashu waxay u baahan yihiin taageero luqadeed oo isku xidha barashada shaqo helista, ka mid noqoshada, iyo ka qaybgalka macnaha leh ee bulshada Finnishka - ma aha oo kaliya shahaadooyin dhammaystirka fasalka.",
    "landingPlatformEyebrow": "Hal madal, Seddex waddo",
    "landingPlatformTitleLine1": "YKI, goobta shaqada,",
    "landingPlatformTitleHighlight": "iyo nolosha Finland.",
    "landingPlatformBody": "Saddex waddo oo hal madal ka hooseeya. Dooro midka ku habboon yoolkaaga - ama u ordi dhammaan saddexda machad.",
    "landingPlatformYkiEyebrow": "YKI Diyaarinta",
    "landingPlatformYkiTitle": "Lagu dhisay afarta xirfadood ee imtixaanada.",
    "landingPlatformYkiBody": "Ku hadalka, qorista, akhrinta, dhageysiga - dhaqanka la hagayo oo leh jawaab celin khariidado si YKI u dhiganta shuruudaha shaqada, dhalashada, iyo deganaanshaha joogtada ah.",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalEyebrow": "Xirfadlaha Finnishka",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalTitle": "Dhakhaatiirta, kalkaalisooyinka, kalkaaliyayaasha caafimaadka.",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalBody": "Xaalado xirfad gaar ah, eray bixin, iyo wada hadal Gacan-siinta bukaan-socodka, dukumeenti bukaan-socod, shaqo kooxeed maalinle ah - luqadda shaqada dhabta ah, maaha xaaladaha buugaagta.",
    "landingPlatformLifeEyebrow": "Nolosha Finland",
    "landingPlatformLifeTitle": "Adeegyada maalinlaha ah, isgaarsiinta rasmiga ah.",
    "landingPlatformLifeBody": "Finnishka waxaad u baahan tahay KELA, Migri, daryeelka caafimaadka, dugsiyada, bangiyada, iyo hadafyada mustaqbalka fog ee dhalashada iyo deganaanshaha rasmiga ah.",
    "landingInsideEyebrow": "MAXAA GUDAHA KU JIRA",
    "landingInsideTitleLine1": "Hal madal oo isku xidha",
    "landingInsideTitleLine2": "YKI, shaqada, iyo dejinta.",
    "landingInsideBody": "Arday kastaa wuxuu u kala guuraa inta u dhaxaysa diyaarinta imtixaanka, Finnishka xirfadlaha ah, iyo nolol maalmeedka Finnishka. Floently wuxuu ku hayaa hal waddo oo joogto ah.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersEyebrow": "Ardayda",
    "landingPathwayLearnersTitle": "Gudub YKI, u diyaar garow shaqo, dhis Finnish wakhti dheer ah.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersBody": "Dhaqanka la hagayo ee akhriska, dhegeysiga, qorista, iyo ku hadalka - oo lagu dhisay himilooyinka YKI iyo luqadda Finnishka ee aad dhab ahaantii uga baahan tahay shaqada iyo nolol maalmeedka.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersCta": "Bilow barashada",
    "landingPathwayEmployersEyebrow": "Loo shaqeeyayaasha",
