    "landingPathwayEmployersBody": "Finishka goobta-shaqada gaarka ah ee isgaarsiin badbaado leh, deg deg ah fuulid, iyo sii hayn xoog leh oo waqti dheer ah. Wadooyin u gaar ah xirfadda daryeelka caafimaadka iyo wixii ka dambeeya.",
    "landingPathwayEmployersCta": "Buug shaqo-bixiyaha demo",
    "landingPathwayCitiesEyebrow": "Loogu talagalay magaalooyinka & degmooyinka",
    "landingPathwayCitiesTitle": "Jid luqadeed la miisaami karo, deganayaasha ilaa muwaadiniinta.",
    "landingPathwayCitiesBody": "Ku xidh barashada luqadda shaqo helista, isdhexgalka, iyo ka qaybgalka wakhtiga dheer. Barnaamijyada ka soo jeeda dadka degan shaqsiga ilaa la soo bandhigo magaalada oo dhan.",
