    "onboardingPlanSelectionEmployerCityBody": "Barnaamijyada ururku way ka duwan yihiin is-diiwaangelinta gaarka ah waxaana lagu habayn karaa habaynta barnaamijka.",
    "onboardingProfessionSelectionTitle": "Dooro jidkaaga xirfadeed",
    "onboardingProfessionSelectionSubtitle": "Dooro xirfadda ku habboon hadafkaaga shaqo ee ugu horreeya ee Finland. Waxaad ku dari kartaa xirfado badan hadhow inta lagu jiro hubinta haddii aad u baahan tahay wax ka badan hal door.",
    "onboardingProfessionDoctorDetail": "Isdhexgalka bukaanka, sharraxaadaha, dukumentiyada, iyo isgaarsiinta goobta shaqada ee goobaha daryeelka caafimaadka.",
    "onboardingProfessionNurseDetail": "Daryeelka bukaanka, wareejinta, warbixinta, wada shaqaynta, iyo luqadda la taaban karo ee shaqada kalkaalinta maalinlaha ah.",
    "onboardingProfessionPracticalNurseDetail": "Shaqada daryeelka, joogtada ah, deganayaasha, qaraabada, iyo isgaarsiinta dhabta ah ee deegaanka daryeelka dhabta ah.",
